[00:36.48]Help in our lives, Jehovah provides,
[00:42.56]Shepherds to tend his flock.
[00:50.42]By their example they serve as guides,
[00:57.89]Showing us how to walk.
[01:04.91](Chorus)
[01:05.06]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
[01:12.38]Men who are loyal and true.
