[01:27.18]Love them for all that they do.
[01:32.16]Shepherds who love us care how we feel;
[01:35.22]Gently they guide the way.
[01:37.82]When we are hurt, they help us to heal,
[01:41.41]Kind in the words they say.
[01:43.85](Chorus)
[01:44.00]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
